        "eyebrow": "Dermatological science, from within",
        "heading": "The Science of Internal Skin Health",
        "body": "<p>Skin is not an isolated surface. It is a living organ influenced by nutrition, environmental exposure, immune signaling, oxidative stress, the intestinal microbiome, and the integrity of its own barrier.</p><p>Alchemia MD formulates around those interconnected systems.</p><p>Every ingredient is selected for a defined purpose and evaluated against published research. The goal is not to replace topical skincare or sun protection. It is to add evidence-informed nutritional support to a complete skin-health routine.</p>",
