        "anchor": "research",
        "eyebrow": "Our standard",
        "heading": "Research first. Claims second.",
        "body": "<p>Not all scientific evidence is equal. Alchemia MD evaluates ingredients using the totality of available research, with greater weight given to controlled human studies and systematic reviews than to laboratory or animal findings.</p>",
        "columns": "4",
        "show_images": false,
        "note": "<p><strong>Ingredient research is not the same as finished-product clinical testing.</strong> Research presented on this page describes published studies on individual ingredients or biological pathways. Unless specifically stated otherwise, these studies were not conducted on Alchemia MD finished products.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_url": ""
