            "title": "Environmental stress",
            "text": "<p>UV and other environmental exposures can influence oxidative stress and cellular responses in skin.</p><p>Research on ingredients such as nicotinamide and Polypodium leucotomos has examined biological responses to UV exposure in human volunteers.</p>",
