          "settings": {
            "number": "",
            "kicker": "",
            "icon": "cell",
            "title": "Gut–skin axis",
            "text": "<p>The intestine and skin communicate through microbial metabolites, immune signaling, barrier integrity, and other systemic pathways.</p><p>The gut-skin axis is an active area of research, although the clinical effects of probiotics remain strain- and formulation-specific.</p>",
            "tag": "Microbiome and skin communication",
            "study": "szanto-gut-skin-2019",
            "asset": "science-system-gut-skin.webp"
          }
        },
