            "evidence": "Emerging / preclinical",
            "why": "<p>Spirulina contains proteins, minerals, carotenoids, and phycocyanin, and contributes a different nutritional and antioxidant profile from the formula's polyphenols.</p>",
            "shows_label": "What research shows",
